 . ELIGIBILITY: open to individuals\, collectives and organisations.\n\nOrg
 anisation: City of Schwabach\, Kulturamt\nLocation: Schwabach\, Germany. B
 iennale 7 to 22 August 2027.\nAward: EUR 1\,000 expenses per selected arti
 st\; jury prizes EUR 6\,000 and EUR 3\,000\; audience prizes EUR 3\,000\, 
 2\,000 and 1\,000.\nDuration: Biennale 7 to 22 August 2027\n\nMore: https:
 //www.schwabach.de/ortung?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium
