SUMMARY:Deadline: Zinegoak 2027 Official Section (Bilbao LGTBIQA+ film fest
 ival\; prizes up to EUR 4\,000)
DESCRIPTION:Zinegoak's official section screens features and shorts on sexu
 al and gender diversity in the FIK\, DOK and KRAK sections (over 45 minute
 s) and a shorts section (under 45 minutes). ELIGIBILITY: films from any co
 untry produced after 1 January 2025 and not previously released commercial
 ly in the Basque Country. OFFER: cash prizes from EUR 1\,000 to EUR 4\,000
 \, paid in Q4 2027.\n\nOrganisation: Zinegoak\, Bilbao International LGTBI
 QA+ Film and Performing Arts Festival\nLocation: Bilbao\, Spain. Festival 
 21 to 29 June 2027. Films from any country.\nAward: Grand Prix best featur
 e EUR 4\,000\; Diversity and Human Rights Award EUR 3\,000\; Lesbianism an
 d Gender Award EUR 3\,000\; Audience Award best short EUR 1\,000. Prizes a
 re taxed and split 50/50 with a Spanish distributor where one exists. No e
 ntry fee stated.\nDuration: Festival 21 to 29 June 2027\n\nMore: https://z
 inegoak.com/en/izen-ematea/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medi
 um=referral
URL:https://zinegoak.com/en/izen-ematea/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantd
 esk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Bilbao\, Spain. Festival 21 to 29 June 2027. Films from any countr
 y.
