TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261119
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261120
SUMMARY:Deadline: Arts Council of Ireland: Theatre Project Award 2027\, Rou
 nd 2
DESCRIPTION:The Theatre Project Award supports specific artistic projects i
 n theatre\, enabling individual artists and organisations to bring their i
 deas to fruition and create excellent work\, from script and concept devel
 opment through to new creations\, including devised\, interdisciplinary an
 d technology-led performance. WHO: individual theatre artists and theatre 
 organisations based in Ireland.\n\nOrganisation: Arts Council of Ireland /
  An Chomhairle Ealaion\nLocation: Republic of Ireland. For theatre artists
  and organisations based in Ireland.\nAward: Up to EUR 26\,000 in Round 2.
  The award's strands are Play Development (up to EUR 15\,000)\, Theatre Cr
 eation (up to EUR 26\,000)\, Theatre Presentation (up to EUR 80\,000) and 
 Theatre Production (up to EUR 175\,000)\; the two larger strands ran in Ro
 und 1. No application fee.\nDuration: Specific theatre projects in 2027. O
 pened 20 October 2026.\n\nMore: https://www.artscouncil.ie/funding-opportu
