  Akademie der Bildenden Künste München\nLocation: Munich\, Germany. AdBK
  München students and recent graduates only.\nAward: EUR 5\,000 productio
 n budget\, plus an exhibition at the AkademieGalerie\; the work enters the
  Goetz collection. No application fee.\nDuration: Work to be completed by 
 end of July 2027\n\nMore: https://www.sammlung-goetz.de/assets/sammlung-go
 etz/Bilder_und_Dokumente/News/2026/Ausschreibung_Medienkunstpreis_2027_DE.
